## 6. API 能力分组（已实现）

| 分组 | 路径前缀 | 说明 |
|------|----------|------|
| Auth | `/api/auth/*` | NextAuth、注册、验证、重置密码 |
| Public 目录 | `/api/public/*` | franchises、instances-v2、programs-v2、categories、testimonials、resources |
| Enrollments | `/api/enrollments/*` | 购物车、结账、订单、候补、退款 |
| User | `/api/user/*` | 资料、头像、账单、发票、推荐 |
| Payments | `/api/payments/*` | Stripe Checkout、Webhook、success |
| Students | `/api/students/*`、`/api/students/me` | 子女档案 |
| Admin CRUD | `/api/admin/*` | 全站后台数据操作 |
| Newsletter | `/api/admin/newsletter/*`、`/api/public/newsletter/*` | 订阅、发送、统计 |
| Webhooks | `/api/webhooks/resend` | Resend 联系人/退订同步 |
| Traffic | `/api/public/traffic/*`、`/api/admin/traffic/*` | 采集与分析（见 `traffic-analytics.mdc`） |
| AI | `/api/ai/chat`、`/api/ai/programs-chat` | Gemini 校区 / DeepSeek 目录 |
| Cron | `/api/cron/*` | 过期购物车、候补、Newsletter |
| Legacy | `/api/courses/*` | 旧课程 API |

